WEBVTT

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:03.904
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 1

00:00:14.625 --> 00:00:19.471
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Hello, everybody, and welcome to today’s <i>What’s My Job</i>?

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:24.176
On team A, we have Nadine, Tyler, and James.

00:00:24.652 --> 00:00:26.200
<v><b>Nadine, Tyler, and James:</b></v> Hello.

00:00:26.684 --> 00:00:30.655
<v><b>Host:</b></v> And on the B team, Alice, George, and Charlie.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.691
<v><b>Alice, George, and Charlie:</b></v> Hello.

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:35.266
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Team A, you start.

00:00:35.891 --> 00:00:38.824
Today’s mystery guest is Mike.

00:00:39.521 --> 00:00:46.062
You each say who Mike is and what he does, but only one story is true.

00:00:46.819 --> 00:00:51.225
Team B, you need to decide who Mike really is.

00:00:51.809 --> 00:00:56.666
Remember, you have one minute to ask Team A questions,

00:00:56.754 --> 00:01:02.107
and then 30 seconds to ask Mike questions. Are we ready?

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.313
<v><b>Teams A and B:</b></v> Yes!

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.003
Ready!

00:01:04.454 --> 00:01:07.105
<v><b>Host:</b></v> So, let’s welcome Mike.

00:01:12.202 --> 00:01:13.198
Team A.

00:01:13.445 --> 00:01:15.883
Nadine, please introduce him.

00:01:16.457 --> 00:01:18.573
<v><b>Nadine:</b></v> Mike’s my hair stylist.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.159
We like to chat a lot.

00:01:21.779 --> 00:01:24.844
<v><b>Host:</b></v> And, Tyler, please introduce Mike…

00:01:25.373 --> 00:01:26.728
<v><b>Tyler:</b></v> Mike’s my dentist.

00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:28.756
He’s a very good dentist.

00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:33.288
<v><b>Host:</b></v> And finally, James, please introduce Mike…

00:01:33.812 --> 00:01:36.489
<v><b>James:</b></v> Mike’s the chef at my local restaurant.

00:01:36.938 --> 00:01:39.188
I often have lunch or dinner there.

00:01:39.911 --> 00:01:41.351
<v><b>Host:</b></v> OK, Team B.

00:01:41.464 --> 00:01:45.143
You have one minute to ask Team A questions.